// ReaProof reference LIBRARY - imported by ReaProof_Gain_Imports.jsfx.
// Functions defined in the @init of an imported file become available to the
// importing effect (official import semantics); shipping libraries next to
// the effect is the standard JSFX packaging layout, which is why the battery
// installs referenced files alongside the subject.
@init
function db2gain(db) ( 10^(db/20) );
